{"seq":1,"slug":"crash-reporting-systems","title":"崩溃上报体系","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-analytics-crash-reporting/crash-stability/crash-reporting-systems","wordCount":1424,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"崩溃上报体系\">崩溃上报体系</h1><p>应用崩溃时用户看到的是一个闪退或白屏，而开发者在千里之外需要还原出那一刻的完整现场。崩溃上报体系（Crash Reporting System）的使命就是自动化这个还原过程——从信号捕获、现场保存、数据上传到 issue 分组、优先级排序，直至推送给正确的工程师修复。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>崩溃上报体系的核心链路是：<strong>捕获</strong>（在进程终止前保存现场）→ <strong>上报</strong>（下次启动时将数据发送到后端）→ <strong>分组</strong>（将相同根因的崩溃聚合为 Issue）→ <strong>排序</strong>（按影响面确定修复优先级）。整个链路的设计约束是：崩溃发生时应用已处于不稳定状态，捕获逻辑本身必须极其安全。</p>\n<h2 id=\"崩溃捕获机制\">崩溃捕获机制</h2><p>移动端崩溃本质上是操作系统向进程发送终止信号。不同平台的捕获机制有根本差异：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>平台</th>\n<th>崩溃类型</th>\n<th>捕获机制</th>\n<th>典型信号/异常</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>iOS (Swift/ObjC)</td>\n<td>Mach 异常</td>\n<td>Mach exception handler</td>\n<td>EXC_BAD_ACCESS, EXC_CRASH</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>iOS (Swift/ObjC)</td>\n<td>UNIX 信号</td>\n<td>Signal handler</td>\n<td>SIGSEGV, SIGABRT, SIGBUS</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>iOS (Swift/ObjC)</td>\n<td>NSException</td>\n<td><code>NSSetUncaughtExceptionHandler</code></td>\n<td>NSRangeException, NSInvalidArgument</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Android (Java/Kotlin)</td>\n<td>未捕获异常</td>\n<td><code>Thread.setDefaultUncaughtExceptionHandler</code></td>\n<td>NullPointerException, OOM</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Android (NDK)</td>\n<td>Native crash</td>\n<td>Signal handler (SIGSEGV, SIGABRT)</td>\n<td>空指针解引用、栈溢出</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Android 11+</td>\n<td>进程退出</td>\n<td><code>ApplicationExitInfo</code> API</td>\n<td>ANR, OOM, 系统 kill</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[应用运行中] --&gt; B{异常发生}&#10;    B --&gt;|Mach 异常/UNIX 信号| C[Signal Handler]&#10;    B --&gt;|语言级异常| D[Exception Handler]&#10;    B --&gt;|OOM/系统 kill| E[下次启动检测]&#10;    C --&gt; F[收集线程堆栈]&#10;    D --&gt; F&#10;    E --&gt; F&#10;    F --&gt; G[写入本地 crash log]&#10;    G --&gt; H[下次启动读取并上报]&#10;    H --&gt; I[服务端接收]&#10;    I --&gt; J[符号化]&#10;    J --&gt; K[Issue 分组]&#10;    K --&gt; L[告警与指派]\">flowchart TD\n    A[应用运行中] --&gt; B{异常发生}\n    B --&gt;|Mach 异常/UNIX 信号| C[Signal Handler]\n    B --&gt;|语言级异常| D[Exception Handler]\n    B --&gt;|OOM/系统 kill| E[下次启动检测]\n    C --&gt; F[收集线程堆栈]\n    D --&gt; F\n    E --&gt; F\n    F --&gt; G[写入本地 crash log]\n    G --&gt; H[下次启动读取并上报]\n    H --&gt; I[服务端接收]\n    I --&gt; J[符号化]\n    J --&gt; K[Issue 分组]\n    K --&gt; L[告警与指派]</pre><p>崩溃捕获的核心难点在于<strong>处理器本身必须极其安全</strong>。当应用处于崩溃状态时，堆、锁、文件系统都可能已经损坏。Signal handler 中只能使用 async-signal-safe 函数（不能 malloc、不能使用 Objective-C runtime、不能持有锁）。最安全的做法是在 handler 中仅写入最小数据到预分配的内存映射文件（mmap），完整的堆栈回溯在下次启动时处理。</p>\n<h2 id=\"崩溃现场数据\">崩溃现场数据</h2><p>一份有效的崩溃报告需要包含足够的上下文信息来重建现场：</p>\n<p><strong>核心数据</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>异常类型与错误码（如 <code>SIGSEGV</code> at address <code>0x00000010</code>）</li>\n<li>崩溃线程的完整调用栈（未符号化的地址列表）</li>\n<li>所有线程的栈帧快照</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>环境数据</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>设备型号、OS 版本、CPU 架构</li>\n<li>应用版本（build number）、编译配置</li>\n<li>可用内存、磁盘空间、电池状态</li>\n<li>前后台状态、网络连接类型</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>行为数据</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Breadcrumbs（崩溃前的关键事件序列，通常保留最近 50-100 条）</li>\n<li>用户自定义 log（通过 <code>Crashlytics.log()</code> 或 <code>SentrySDK.addBreadcrumb()</code> 记录）</li>\n<li>用户标识（可选，用于关联到具体用户会话）</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Breadcrumbs 与<a href=\"../analytics-fundamentals/event-tracking-design\">事件埋点</a>的交汇点：埋点事件可以自动作为 breadcrumbs 注入崩溃报告，让工程师在修复崩溃时能看到&quot;用户在崩溃前做了什么&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"issue-分组算法\">Issue 分组算法</h2><p>一个应用每天可能上报数万条崩溃。逐条查看不现实，必须将相同根因的崩溃聚合为 Issue。分组质量直接决定团队的修复效率。</p>\n<p><strong>基于栈帧的分组</strong>（Stack Frame Grouping）是最常见的策略——取崩溃线程的 Top-N 帧作为指纹：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>fingerprint</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>hash</mtext><mo fence=\"true\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">(</mo><msub><mtext>frame</mtext><mn>1</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∥</mi><msub><mtext>frame</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∥</mi><mo>⋯</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∥</mi><msub><mtext>frame</mtext><mi>k</mi></msub><mo fence=\"true\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{fingerprint} = \\text{hash}\\bigl(\\text{frame}_1 \\| \\text{frame}_2 \\| \\cdots \\| \\text{frame}_k\\bigr)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">fingerprint</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">hash</span></span><span class=\"mopen\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">frame</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∥</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">frame</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">⋯</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∥</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">frame</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 通常取 3-5。但这种方法面临 OEM 碎片化问题：三星、小米等厂商注入的自定义系统类可能改变栈帧，导致同一 bug 被分成多个 Issue。</p>\n<p>Sentry 的分组策略更精细：它首先剥离系统框架帧和第三方 SDK 帧，只保留应用代码帧参与指纹计算。同时支持自定义指纹规则——当默认分组不准确时，开发者可以通过 <code>beforeSend</code> hook 覆盖指纹：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"SentrySDK.start { options in&#10;    options.beforeSend = { event in&#10;        if event.exceptions?.first?.type == &quot;DatabaseCorruptionError&quot; {&#10;            event.fingerprint = [&quot;database-corruption&quot;, event.tags?[&quot;db_version&quot;] ?? &quot;unknown&quot;]&#10;        }&#10;        return event&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">SentrySDK.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">start</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { options </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    options.beforeSend </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { event </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> event.exceptions</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">first</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.type </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"DatabaseCorruptionError\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            event.fingerprint </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"database-corruption\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, event.tags</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"db_version\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">??</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"unknown\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> event</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"稳定性指标\">稳定性指标</h2><p>崩溃率的度量方式影响团队对稳定性的判断：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>计算方式</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Crash-free Users</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mtext>崩溃用户数</mtext><mtext>活跃用户数</mtext></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1 - \\frac{\\text{崩溃用户数}}{\\text{活跃用户数}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2173em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8723em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">活跃用户数</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">崩溃用户数</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>影响面评估，Google Play Vitals 采用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Crash-free Sessions</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mtext>崩溃会话数</mtext><mtext>总会话数</mtext></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1 - \\frac{\\text{崩溃会话数}}{\\text{总会话数}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2173em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8723em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">总会话数</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">崩溃会话数</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>频率评估，Firebase Crashlytics 默认</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Crashes per DAU</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mtext>崩溃次数</mtext><mtext>DAU</mtext></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{\\text{崩溃次数}}{\\text{DAU}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2173em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8723em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">DAU</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">崩溃次数</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>绝对量级追踪</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>MTBF</td>\n<td>平均无故障时间</td>\n<td>设备级稳定性</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Google Play Console 的 Android Vitals 将崩溃率阈值设为：crash-free rate &lt; 98% 时标记为&quot;不良体验&quot;，可能影响应用在商店的推荐权重。Apple App Store 没有公开类似阈值，但 Xcode Organizer 中的&quot;On-Screen Terminations&quot;指标提供了对标基准。</p>\n<p>行业基准（2026）：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>优秀：Crash-free Users &gt; 99.5%</li>\n<li>良好：99.0% - 99.5%</li>\n<li>需关注：98.0% - 99.0%</li>\n<li>紧急：&lt; 98.0%</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"崩溃上报工具链对比\">崩溃上报工具链对比</h2><p>2026 年主流工具的能力矩阵：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>能力</th>\n<th>Firebase Crashlytics</th>\n<th>Sentry</th>\n<th>Bugsnag</th>\n<th>Embrace</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>价格</td>\n<td>免费无限量</td>\n<td>5K events/月免费</td>\n<td>7.5K events/月免费</td>\n<td>1M sessions/月免费</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>AI 辅助诊断</td>\n<td>Gemini 集成（2025）</td>\n<td>Autofix (Beta)</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>无</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ANR 检测</td>\n<td>Android 18.3.0+ 自动</td>\n<td>v2 (ApplicationExitInfo)</td>\n<td>支持</td>\n<td>支持</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>NDK crash</td>\n<td>需额外依赖</td>\n<td>内置</td>\n<td>插件形式</td>\n<td>内置</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Session Replay</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>支持（移动端截图序列）</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>时间线形式</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Jira 双向同步</td>\n<td>单向</td>\n<td>双向</td>\n<td>双向</td>\n<td>单向</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Suspect Commits</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>支持</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>无</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>选型建议：团队规模 &lt;20 人且预算敏感选 Crashlytics（零成本、接入最快）；需要深度诊断能力（suspect commits、自定义分组、Session Replay）选 Sentry；重度原生开发（大量 C++ NDK 代码）需要评估 Embrace 的 session-level 关联能力。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>崩溃上报体系是移动稳定性治理的基础设施。Signal Handler 的安全性约束决定了捕获层的设计复杂度；Breadcrumbs 将崩溃从孤立事件还原为有上下文的故事；Issue 分组质量直接影响团队修复效率；Crash-free rate 是面向商店（Google Play Vitals）和面向用户的稳定性契约。崩溃被捕获和分组后，下一步是<a href=\"symbolication-deobfuscation\">符号化与反混淆</a>——将原始内存地址还原为可读的源码位置。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"崩溃上报体系","id":"崩溃上报体系"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"崩溃捕获机制","id":"崩溃捕获机制"},{"level":2,"text":"崩溃现场数据","id":"崩溃现场数据"},{"level":2,"text":"Issue 分组算法","id":"issue-分组算法"},{"level":2,"text":"稳定性指标","id":"稳定性指标"},{"level":2,"text":"崩溃上报工具链对比","id":"崩溃上报工具链对比"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"归因与漏斗分析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-analytics-crash-reporting/analytics-fundamentals/attribution-funnel"},"next":{"title":"符号化与反混淆","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-analytics-crash-reporting/crash-stability/symbolication-deobfuscation"}}